  "details": "When Steadycam is enabled if you open the Stream Camera it will reset to disabled after closing the stream camera. \n\nI'm unsure if this is a bug or an intended feature, but if so I'd like to request a setting at least to change it back. \n\nAs a VRChat streamer I adopted this system so I can comfortably stream first-person adventures to my viewers and switch to camera view to talk with chat on the fly. Now I'd have to re-enable steadycam every time I want to open the stream camera.\n\nExample posted on my twitter\n\nhttps://x.com/ProjektKisu/status/2087314815169810543?s=20",
